 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. PWORDS.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
*    WORDS - data (PROCS/WORDS.SNP; the notes are there)
 01  NW-AMOUNT    PIC 9(7)V99.
 01  NW-WORDS     PIC X(100).
 01  NW-WT REDEFINES NW-WORDS.
     05  NW-WC    PIC X OCCURS 100.
 01  NW-UV.
     05  FILLER   PIC X(36)
             VALUE "ONE      TWO      THREE    FOUR     ".
     05  FILLER   PIC X(36)
             VALUE "FIVE     SIX      SEVEN    EIGHT    ".
     05  FILLER   PIC X(36)
             VALUE "NINE     TEN      ELEVEN   TWELVE   ".
     05  FILLER   PIC X(36)
             VALUE "THIRTEEN FOURTEEN FIFTEEN  SIXTEEN  ".
     05  FILLER   PIC X(27)
             VALUE "SEVENTEENEIGHTEEN NINETEEN ".
 01  NW-US REDEFINES NW-UV.
     05  NW-UNIT  PIC X(9) OCCURS 19.
 01  NW-TV.
     05  FILLER   PIC X(28)
             VALUE "TWENTY THIRTY FORTY  FIFTY  ".
     05  FILLER   PIC X(28)
             VALUE "SIXTY  SEVENTYEIGHTY NINETY ".
 01  NW-TS REDEFINES NW-TV.
     05  NW-TEN   PIC X(7) OCCURS 8.
 01  NW-WORD      PIC X(9).
 01  NW-WK REDEFINES NW-WORD.
     05  NW-WKC   PIC X OCCURS 9.
 01  NW-CW.
     05  NW-CW-N  PIC XX.
     05  FILLER   PIC X(4) VALUE "/100".
 77  NW-INT       PIC 9(7).
 77  NW-CENTS     PIC 99.
 77  NW-GRP       PIC 999.
 77  NW-H         PIC 9.
 77  NW-R         PIC 99.
 77  NW-T         PIC 9.
 77  NW-O         PIC 9.
 77  NW-POS       PIC 999.
 77  NW-K         PIC 99.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     MOVE 1234.56 TO NW-AMOUNT. PERFORM NW-CONVERT.
     DISPLAY "W1 ONE THOUSAND...FOUR AND 56/100".
     DISPLAY "   " NW-WORDS.
     MOVE 7777777.77 TO NW-AMOUNT. PERFORM NW-CONVERT.
     DISPLAY "W2 (the longest)".
     DISPLAY "   " NW-WORDS.
     MOVE 0.05 TO NW-AMOUNT. PERFORM NW-CONVERT.
     DISPLAY "W3 ZERO AND 05/100".
     DISPLAY "   " NW-WORDS.
     MOVE 1000100 TO NW-AMOUNT. PERFORM NW-CONVERT.
     DISPLAY "W4 ONE MILLION ONE HUNDRED AND 00/100".
     DISPLAY "   " NW-WORDS.
     MOVE 90015.1 TO NW-AMOUNT. PERFORM NW-CONVERT.
     DISPLAY "W5 NINETY THOUSAND FIFTEEN AND 10/100".
     DISPLAY "   " NW-WORDS.
     STOP RUN.
*    WORDS - the paragraphs
 NW-CONVERT.
*    millions, thousands and units are each a group
*    of three digits said the same way
     MOVE SPACES TO NW-WORDS.
     MOVE 1 TO NW-POS.
     MOVE NW-AMOUNT TO NW-INT.
     COMPUTE NW-CENTS = (NW-AMOUNT - NW-INT) * 100.
     IF NW-INT = 0
         MOVE "ZERO" TO NW-WORD
         PERFORM NW-ADD-WORD
     END-IF.
     DIVIDE NW-INT BY 1000000 GIVING NW-GRP REMAINDER NW-INT.
     IF NW-GRP > 0
         PERFORM NW-GROUP
         MOVE "MILLION" TO NW-WORD
         PERFORM NW-ADD-WORD
     END-IF.
     DIVIDE NW-INT BY 1000 GIVING NW-GRP REMAINDER NW-INT.
     IF NW-GRP > 0
         PERFORM NW-GROUP
         MOVE "THOUSAND" TO NW-WORD
         PERFORM NW-ADD-WORD
     END-IF.
     MOVE NW-INT TO NW-GRP.
     IF NW-GRP > 0
         PERFORM NW-GROUP
     END-IF.
     MOVE "AND" TO NW-WORD.
     PERFORM NW-ADD-WORD.
     MOVE NW-CENTS TO NW-CW-N.
     MOVE NW-CW TO NW-WORD.
     PERFORM NW-ADD-WORD.
 NW-GROUP.
*    NW-GRP, 1 to 999
     DIVIDE NW-GRP BY 100 GIVING NW-H REMAINDER NW-R.
     IF NW-H > 0
         MOVE NW-UNIT(NW-H) TO NW-WORD
         PERFORM NW-ADD-WORD
         MOVE "HUNDRED" TO NW-WORD
         PERFORM NW-ADD-WORD
     END-IF.
     IF NW-R > 0 AND NW-R < 20
         MOVE NW-UNIT(NW-R) TO NW-WORD
         PERFORM NW-ADD-WORD
     END-IF.
     IF NW-R > 19
         DIVIDE NW-R BY 10 GIVING NW-T REMAINDER NW-O
         SUBTRACT 1 FROM NW-T
         MOVE NW-TEN(NW-T) TO NW-WORD
         PERFORM NW-ADD-WORD
         IF NW-O > 0
*            TWENTY-ONE: the hyphen takes the space
             SUBTRACT 1 FROM NW-POS
             MOVE "-" TO NW-WC(NW-POS)
             ADD 1 TO NW-POS
             MOVE NW-UNIT(NW-O) TO NW-WORD
             PERFORM NW-ADD-WORD
         END-IF
     END-IF.
 NW-ADD-WORD.
*    NW-WORD onto the end of NW-WORDS, then a space
     PERFORM VARYING NW-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NW-K > 9
         IF NW-WKC(NW-K) NOT = SPACE
             MOVE NW-WKC(NW-K) TO NW-WC(NW-POS)
             ADD 1 TO NW-POS
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM.
     ADD 1 TO NW-POS.
